{"id":"daru_ber","lemma":"darüber","pos":"adv","rank":222,"glosses":["above, above it/this/that","about it/this/that (concerning a matter)","over, over it/this/that, thereover"],"ipa":"/daˈʁyːbɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-dar%C3%BCber.ogg/De-dar%C3%BCber.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was weißt du darüber?","en":"What do you know about it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700284","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Wissen Sie etwas darüber?","en":"Do you know something about this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711747","words":[{"g":"to know"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Wisst ihr etwas darüber?","en":"Do you know something about this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711748","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Darüber reden wir nie.","en":"We never talk about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760588","words":[null,{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"never, never at all"}]},{"text":"Ich weiß eine Menge darüber.","en":"I know a lot about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756969","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"quantity"},null]}]}